<title>USA: Grancare sees 1996 revenues topping $1 bln.</title>
<headline>Grancare sees 1996 revenues topping $1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grancare Inc expects to report 1996 revenues exceeding $1 billion, including results from its Teamcare pharmacy division, compared with 1995 revenues of $816.4 million.</p>
<p>In an interview with Reuters, Grancare chief financial officer Jerry Schneider said the company also expects 1997 revenues to range from $750 million to $800 million excluding the results of Teamcare, which is being divested in a deal with Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc, a company that is majority owned by Manor Care Inc.</p>
</text>
